cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TessScope, please cite this software and the upstream datasets and models listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."
title: "TessScope: exact cross-runtime gradients for closed-loop microscope co-design"
type: software
authors:
  - name: rajpatilrobotics
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-02
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - differentiable optics
  - computational microscopy
  - autofocus
  - instance segmentation
  - tesseract
abstract: >-
  TessScope composes JAX/Chromatix optics, NumPy/SciPy autofocus, and
  PyTorch/InstanSeg through Tesseract to optimize a closed-loop fluorescence
  microscope with exact cross-runtime vector-Jacobian products.
